      "lineNbr": 59,
      "author": {
        "id": 1021605
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-08T22:30:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for catching this. Could we (the platform) also own the out array, and make max a size_t *outCount out parameter? That way there is nothing to do for the caller to clean up, or manage the count.",
      "parentUuid": "ac6f4bb7_4d792319",
      "range": {
